  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Ore-Creeper/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Ore-Creeper?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white&color=364763\" alt=\"問題回報\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fore-creeper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/ore-creeper/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tt26lbp.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組會根據遊戲內建的礦石類型新增相應的苦力怕。在探索過程中，你會發現它們；當它們爆炸時，周圍的方塊會根據苦力怕的種類變成對應的礦石！「礦石 TNT」能將普通苦力怕轉變為礦石苦力怕！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這些苦力怕不會造成任何傷害，但若你選擇擊殺它們，它們也會掉落一些戰利品。模組內建設定檔，你可自行調整生成機率與爆炸範圍。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/3c3AeAgjwUrxxHHMvC/giphy.gif?cid=790b761105b1f854bcf1755223d062ae19da9783192e511a&rid=giphy.gif&ct=g\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tt26lbp.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><strong>生成率調整數據包</strong></h2>\n<p>若要在 NeoForge 與 Forge 平台下修改礦石苦力怕的生成機率，請修改並套用以下<a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Ore-Creeper/tree/1.21/datapacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據包</a>。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>資源包相容性</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/squishys-reanimated-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/title/squishys-reanimated-mobs.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
